Figure 8:Qualitative comparisons between Qwen3.5-4B and ZwZ2-4B.Three selected examples show correct predictions by ZwZ2-4B where the base model fails:
(a) identifying a category present in every image;
(b) associating recognized text with the queried location;
and (c) counting all instances in a structured arrangement.
Responses are excerpted from the original outputs, with omissions marked by[...]and answer fields reformatted.
The enlarged image region in (b) is provided for visualization only.
